# Kai's chosen nonland name matches an opponent's spell and makes that opponent lose 3 life (CR 201.3, 603.2, 119.3).
# Kai Winn, Faithless Leader {1}{B}: Legendary Creature — Bajoran Cleric
#   As Kai Winn enters, choose a nonland card name.
#   Whenever an opponent casts a spell with the chosen name or activates an ability of a source with the chosen name, that player loses 3 life.
# Bot2 casts Opt; the chosen name is made explicitly as Kai enters.

[Bot1 Deck]
Kai Winn, Faithless Leader
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Island
Opt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Kai Winn, Faithless Leader.Cast
Bot1.Name(Opt)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Opt.Cast
Bot2.Pass

